1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,419
The central idea.

2
00:00:01,419 --> 00:00:03,645
Behind the day lies a life.

3
00:00:03,645 --> 00:00:07,695
Morning, birth and childhood, can be told perfectly.

4
00:00:07,695 --> 00:00:10,559
Evening, death, can only be imagined.

5
00:00:10,559 --> 00:00:12,877
The word death never appears.

6
00:00:12,877 --> 00:00:21,523
Instead we get a boundary, a crossing, the other side, a figure in grey, a gate shut gently, and a flock led home.

